<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Lehman and Bear Stearns cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Lehman and Bear Stearns cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Schroder Wertheim said it downgraded Bear Stearns Cos Inc and Lehman Brothers Holdings Inc to &quot;perform in line&quot; from outperform.  </p>
<p>-- Additional details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Lehman shares fell 1/4 to 34-1/4 and Bear Stearns fell 1/4 to 29-7/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
